  "problem": "get_asset returned empty unknown placeholders for every collection. Clients could not obtain real follow-up IDs. Rolling HCRIS URLs could be minted as exact releases. Collection limits could silently clip required context. Tests could inject fake release IDs. Enrichment could be imported into worker/index.mjs.",
